1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:08,360
This is a special broadcast live from Ghazza, November the 14th, evening.

2
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:22,500
Alhamdulillah, we are getting rain, we are getting fresh water so that the animals, the plants, the human beings can all drink.

3
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:28,260
Allah subhanahu wa ta'ala is greater than anything or anyone.

4
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:34,720
He is our refuge, he is our provider.

5
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:54,120
The skies have opened, hence everyone here is supplicating, asking God to provide victory, to provide steadfastness to all the people in this world, to all the free people in this world, including the people here in Ghazza, Palestine.

6
00:00:54,120 --> 00:01:01,460
InshaAllah, we see you here soon. 38 days, we are still strong.

7
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:05,740
We see you, we hear you, continue doing what you are doing.

8
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,200
As-salamu alaykum, peace be upon you.

